Marcos von Sperling. Biological Wastewater Treatment Series, volume 1, IWA Publishing, 2007. [Publisher](https://iwaponline.com/ebooks/book/72/Wastewater-Characteristics-Treatment-and-Disposal) · [DOI](https://doi.org/10.2166/9781780402086).

Read the complete book as the introductory wastewater spine. Connect wastewater quantities and constituents with effects on receiving waters, treatment choices, sludge and planning. Carry one catchment and its daily material account through the reading.

The publisher's series description identifies the volumes as open-access ebooks; this volume's direct page returned 403 during automated review. Consult the publisher download and preserve its actual licence rather than applying another volume's terms. The 2007 treatment account needs current environmental and public-health references alongside it.

